          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The more people you have looking at you, the more content you are, and you take every opportunity to show up others when their performances are less than perfect.</p>\n<p>You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Upstage] reaction. In addition, when you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Earn Income], if the level of the task is higher than your level, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your check to Earn Income.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.vx5FGEG34AxI2dow.JournalEntryPage.h1zdUIWX1k5PKTnc]{Celebrity}</p>"
          },
